WEBVTT

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:22.088
Though you are so close,
Kore hodo soba ni

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:26.593
I cannot tell you how I feel.
Iru no ni tsutaerarezu

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:30.663
The more strongly I feel,
Tsuyoku omou hodo

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:35.268
the harder it is for me to find the words.
Kotoba ga mitsukaranai

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:43.309
What is sad is not fate...
Kanashii no wa unmei ja nakute

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:54.083
...but that all encounters come to an end.
Deai no subete ni owari ga aru koto

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:58.525
O incomplete beings,
Mikan naru mono

00:00:58.525 --> 00:01:02.962
awaken, for beyond the night...
mezameyo yoru o koetara

00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:07.033
At the end of the desert...
Sabaku no hate ni

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:14.701
...the truth surely awaits you.
Shinjitsu ga matteru yo kitto

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:53.213
Aren't they done yet?

00:01:53.213 --> 00:01:54.703
If this takes too long...

00:01:55.615 --> 00:01:59.016
If you're that jittery, don't trade banned goods.

00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:02.286
It's no big deal, even if you get
caught by the Inspection Force.

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:04.422
You just have to lay low for 3 or 4 years and...

00:02:06.659 --> 00:02:07.523
What the heck's going on?

00:02:08.328 --> 00:02:09.522
What is it? What's wrong?

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:11.555
Don't tell me...

00:02:16.136 --> 00:02:17.034
W-What's that?!

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:26.944
Against law breakers who have gone to far,

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:30.681
at times, The Third unleash
their ultimate punishment.

00:02:31.784 --> 00:02:34.754
This autonomous soldier that felt
no compunction towards massacre...

00:02:34.754 --> 00:02:36.984
...was fearfully called thus...

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:42.092
Blue Breaker

00:03:09.923 --> 00:03:12.357
As always, worthy of being
called the Sword Dancer,

00:03:12.792 --> 00:03:16.193
Honoka's swordsmanship is a brilliant dance.

00:03:17.597 --> 00:03:19.588
Because she is being protective
of her injured right arm,

00:03:19.732 --> 00:03:22.496
her movements are unnatural,
compared to how they usually are.

00:03:22.902 --> 00:03:24.563
But even so, the difference is so slight,

00:03:24.737 --> 00:03:27.103
it would hardly be noticeable
unless it was pointed out.

00:03:31.711 --> 00:03:34.771
Anything short of a miracle can be cut.

00:03:35.215 --> 00:03:39.385
Even miracles, even things that
cannot be cut with a blade...

00:03:39.385 --> 00:03:42.149
...can be cut if it is in your heart.

00:03:42.355 --> 00:03:45.620
However, that will come when all is said and done.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.223
Drawing your sword and swinging it.

00:03:49.362 --> 00:03:51.956
Honoka, that comes easily to you.

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:55.861
So, there are other things you must learn.

00:03:56.502 --> 00:03:57.833
There are other things?

00:03:58.638 --> 00:04:00.936
That's right. They are...

00:04:04.644 --> 00:04:05.804
Am I interrupting?

00:04:06.479 --> 00:04:07.969
I just finished.

00:04:08.681 --> 00:04:10.308
Was that image training?

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:12.447
Well, something like that.

00:04:13.653 --> 00:04:15.382
You sound rather dissatisfied.

00:04:17.223 --> 00:04:19.714
Yeah, it's just not the same with my left hand.

00:04:20.393 --> 00:04:21.382
Does it hurt?

00:04:22.328 --> 00:04:24.091
It's mostly healed now.

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:26.691
And I got medicine back in Emporium.

00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:28.297
Besides,

00:04:29.168 --> 00:04:30.328
I've got you to thank.

00:04:31.037 --> 00:04:33.164
Your ability to recover is strong.

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:37.267
I merely helped it along a little.

00:04:37.343 --> 00:04:39.743
It's called "healing", right?

00:04:40.079 --> 00:04:41.410
I was so surprised.

00:04:42.148 --> 00:04:45.174
You use that power as if it's nothing special.

00:04:46.219 --> 00:04:47.550
You have one, too.

00:04:48.921 --> 00:04:51.446
You also have a special power.

00:04:52.592 --> 00:04:54.287
Yours is no ordinary quick-draw technique.

00:04:55.828 --> 00:04:57.897
I doubt the armor on an autonomous soldier...

00:04:57.897 --> 00:05:00.627
...could be cleft in two
with just speed and timing.

00:05:01.567 --> 00:05:04.559
If you put it that way, maybe that's true.

00:05:05.305 --> 00:05:07.739
But it's nothing that impressive.

00:05:08.074 --> 00:05:10.599
Your healing is way more remarkable.

00:05:10.843 --> 00:05:13.334
After all, your power can save people.

00:05:14.013 --> 00:05:15.344
That is not true.

00:05:17.216 --> 00:05:21.084
It is not as if you use that power
to indiscriminately kill people.

00:05:21.921 --> 00:05:25.186
It is not a power that robs and injures others.

00:05:25.658 --> 00:05:30.595
You wield your sword for yourself
and the things you believe in.

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:31.858
Isn't that right?

00:05:41.708 --> 00:05:43.039
I am the same.

00:05:43.509 --> 00:05:47.445
It is not as if I indiscriminately
use this power on just anyone.

00:05:48.414 --> 00:05:53.681
What can one do? What does one want
to do? What is it one ought to do?

00:05:53.986 --> 00:05:58.980
The creature called man uses his
own wisdom to choose and decide.

00:05:59.559 --> 00:06:02.653
One's powers and skills cannot
make such decisions for themselves.

00:06:04.397 --> 00:06:06.456
Man is an imperfect being.

00:06:06.866 --> 00:06:08.668
He must use his intellect and reason,

00:06:08.668 --> 00:06:11.000
concepts that even he does not fully grasp,

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:13.795
to guide him through life.

00:06:15.908 --> 00:06:19.309
That is exactly why humans
must spend more time...

00:06:19.746 --> 00:06:23.705
...on the simple act of
"living" than other creatures.

00:06:30.723 --> 00:06:31.712
Miss Honoka?

00:06:32.458 --> 00:06:33.584
Is something the matter?

00:06:35.895 --> 00:06:37.192
No, it's nothing.

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:41.466
Pardon me. I seem to have
said some strange things.

00:06:42.101 --> 00:06:42.863
No...

00:06:44.337 --> 00:06:47.670
All of Honoka's feelings that she had
never been able to neatly sum up...

00:06:48.274 --> 00:06:52.040
Iks's words had put them into a
meaningful context, and upon hearing that,

00:06:52.545 --> 00:06:56.606
Honoka felt herself nearly engulfed
by a sudden wave of loneliness.

00:06:57.750 --> 00:07:02.585
Even she did not really understand
where that emotion had come from.

00:07:03.456 --> 00:07:06.721
She just felt a vast chasm...

00:07:07.393 --> 00:07:10.851
...between herself, and the
young man smiling next to her...

00:07:13.633 --> 00:07:17.069
But at the same time, Honoka also felt serene.

00:07:18.171 --> 00:07:21.140
This small burden that she
had always felt in her heart...

00:07:22.108 --> 00:07:24.210
She had met someone...

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:27.543
...who shared the "burden"
of having a special power.

00:07:29.382 --> 00:07:33.182
Even if it might only be a fleeting encounter.

00:07:57.877 --> 00:08:00.641
Okay Hono, here's what you've been waiting for.

00:08:08.821 --> 00:08:11.415
Woohoo! It's all shiny!

00:08:11.891 --> 00:08:13.483
I'll lower the steps for you now.

00:08:13.759 --> 00:08:14.919
Yahoo!

00:08:17.263 --> 00:08:18.698
It's like it's new!

00:08:18.698 --> 00:08:19.632
Awesome!

00:08:19.632 --> 00:08:20.894
No scratches! No dents!

00:08:20.967 --> 00:08:22.867
Pops, you're the best!

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:27.430
Pops, this is giving me the chills!

00:08:27.807 --> 00:08:30.571
You should find the finishing
work to be pretty thorough.

00:08:31.344 --> 00:08:32.311
Wow...

00:08:36.382 --> 00:08:38.179
Hey, what's that?

00:08:38.684 --> 00:08:40.618
A kind of a sword holder.

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:41.846
A special Hono feature.

00:08:44.056 --> 00:08:45.284
Oh, man!

00:08:45.491 --> 00:08:49.291
Oh, man! Pops, you're the best!

00:08:53.699 --> 00:08:58.864
Whoa, the cushions have been
changed to a Warm Type DX!

00:08:58.938 --> 00:09:00.873
And the connector mount's been swapped...

00:09:00.873 --> 00:09:03.276
...with a 38 standard universal type!

00:09:03.276 --> 00:09:06.507
This oil for the power system
is a high-purity arc, right?

00:09:06.679 --> 00:09:07.976
Woohoo!

00:09:08.114 --> 00:09:10.241
Hey, hey, can I try it out a little?

00:09:10.483 --> 00:09:13.384
I don't mind. It's yours now.

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:16.616
But you won't be able to do it dressed like that.

00:09:16.956 --> 00:09:17.547
Huh?

00:09:17.924 --> 00:09:18.822
Hold on a second.

00:09:19.125 --> 00:09:20.114
Down we go...

00:09:21.627 --> 00:09:22.389
Huh?

00:09:22.895 --> 00:09:26.194
Here, a PSP inner suit.

00:09:26.699 --> 00:09:27.631
It's a custom-made piece.

00:09:30.369 --> 00:09:32.234
D-D-D-D-D-Do I have to wear this?

00:09:32.572 --> 00:09:34.597
An inner suit is absolutely necessary.

00:09:35.174 --> 00:09:36.876
You'll be subjected to quite a bit of impact...

00:09:36.876 --> 00:09:39.106
...and it's not like the inside is padded.

00:09:39.245 --> 00:09:40.371
But...

00:09:40.846 --> 00:09:44.976
Hono, this thing is a piece
of precision machinery.

00:09:45.785 --> 00:09:48.219
Static electricity, sweat, dust...

00:09:48.487 --> 00:09:51.047
All those things can lead
to inferior performance.

00:09:51.524 --> 00:09:52.821
However small the possibility.

00:09:53.826 --> 00:09:55.020
All right.

00:09:55.361 --> 00:09:56.191
I'll go change.

00:09:56.929 --> 00:09:59.625
Millie, take Hono to the cabin.

00:09:59.966 --> 00:10:00.830
Okay!

00:10:00.967 --> 00:10:03.401
Come on Hono, time to get changed.

00:10:04.437 --> 00:10:06.029
I hear you hired her for a job?

00:10:06.439 --> 00:10:07.167
Yes.

00:10:07.773 --> 00:10:10.105
I'm hoping to see the work Miss Honoka does.

00:10:10.576 --> 00:10:13.010
So you're interested in Hono.

00:10:13.112 --> 00:10:15.171
I don't mean that in a weird way.

00:10:15.514 --> 00:10:16.242
Yes.

00:10:16.616 --> 00:10:18.015
I feel like I can understand.

00:10:18.317 --> 00:10:20.444
I don't know how to say it... She's...

00:10:21.287 --> 00:10:21.981
...interesting.

00:10:22.688 --> 00:10:23.347
Yes.

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:29.519
Hey, finish changing?

00:10:29.695 --> 00:10:31.595
I'm finished, but...

00:10:31.897 --> 00:10:32.386
Whoa!

00:10:32.932 --> 00:10:34.767
Hey, wait, Millie! Don't push me!

00:10:34.767 --> 00:10:36.826
N-N-No, no! I don't wanna!

00:10:39.138 --> 00:10:41.698
What do you think? Doesn't Hono look cool?

00:10:42.041 --> 00:10:43.235
Oh-ho...

00:10:43.743 --> 00:10:46.268
T-This is embarrassing.

00:10:46.612 --> 00:10:49.581
Well, no one will see it once you're in the PSP.

00:10:50.016 --> 00:10:51.813
P-Pops...

00:10:55.721 --> 00:10:57.245
How's the full-surface monitor?

00:10:57.923 --> 00:11:00.255
Aren't there kinda too many displays?

00:11:00.626 --> 00:11:02.924
You can make it display just the ones you need.

00:11:03.262 --> 00:11:05.059
You can use vocal commands to switch modes.

00:11:05.531 --> 00:11:06.429
Um...

00:11:06.632 --> 00:11:08.065
Then, let's go with the basic display.

00:11:09.869 --> 00:11:10.563
Okay.

00:11:11.070 --> 00:11:12.298
Well, here goes!

00:11:15.374 --> 00:11:16.534
It stood up!

00:11:19.311 --> 00:11:21.836
It's moving! It's like a person!

00:11:22.314 --> 00:11:25.112
It follows Hono's movements exactly, so...

00:11:25.351 --> 00:11:26.443
How is it, Hono?

00:11:26.619 --> 00:11:28.678
This is awesome, Pops!

00:11:29.355 --> 00:11:31.380
I didn't think it would move like this!

00:11:32.058 --> 00:11:33.889
I didn't tune it for nothing.

00:11:34.593 --> 00:11:35.389
I'm going to try getting down.

00:11:42.034 --> 00:11:44.093
Woohoo! Smooth!

00:11:56.315 --> 00:11:59.011
You said it follows Miss Honoka's
movements, correct?

00:11:59.318 --> 00:11:59.784
Yeah.

00:12:00.986 --> 00:12:03.887
Then, for example, Miss Honoka's
quick-draw technique...

00:12:04.190 --> 00:12:05.214
I assume you know of it?

00:12:05.758 --> 00:12:06.884
What about movement like that?

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:09.619
Well, it's theoretically possible.

00:12:12.298 --> 00:12:14.027
Hono, wanna take a little break?

00:12:14.533 --> 00:12:15.522
Hmm...

00:12:15.968 --> 00:12:16.696
Just a little longer.

00:12:18.137 --> 00:12:19.126
Good grief.

00:12:19.638 --> 00:12:22.232
How would you like a cup of tea in our cabin?

00:12:22.875 --> 00:12:24.570
Is it all right to leave her alone here?

00:12:24.810 --> 00:12:26.209
Looks like she's totally engrossed.

00:12:26.345 --> 00:12:28.142
Once she gets like that, it'll be a while.

00:12:28.614 --> 00:12:30.445
Let's let her have her fun for a little longer.

00:12:31.517 --> 00:12:32.779
Millie, you come over here, too.

00:12:33.285 --> 00:12:34.343
Okay.

00:12:35.387 --> 00:12:36.979
Hey, Millie!

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:40.955
Sorry! I'll play with you lots later!

00:12:44.396 --> 00:12:44.828
Okay!

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:18.628
There.

00:13:18.697 --> 00:13:20.824
Was the work there done properly?

00:13:21.167 --> 00:13:24.500
Well, this is beyond the
level of a stopgap repair.

00:13:25.204 --> 00:13:26.603
Joey did this too, didn't he?

00:13:26.739 --> 00:13:27.763
Correct.

00:13:28.007 --> 00:13:30.032
I knew it. It's not bad.

00:13:30.109 --> 00:13:32.509
You seem to have a high opinion of that guy.

00:13:32.745 --> 00:13:34.076
He's a promising one.

00:13:34.413 --> 00:13:37.905
Once I'm gone, you could do
worse than letting him take over.

00:13:37.983 --> 00:13:39.678
That's a long way off.

00:13:43.622 --> 00:13:45.283
He's looking at machines again.

00:13:45.624 --> 00:13:48.752
He can't keep his mind off it,
since it's right there in front of him.

00:13:49.161 --> 00:13:51.891
He seems to like machines more than Millie.

00:13:52.231 --> 00:13:53.858
Are you jealous of machines?

00:13:53.933 --> 00:13:54.399
Yup.

00:13:54.967 --> 00:13:56.059
No, that's a lie.

00:13:56.268 --> 00:13:58.896
He looks kind of cool when he's like that.

00:13:59.371 --> 00:14:01.805
I'm glad if that's how you feel.

00:14:03.309 --> 00:14:07.575
Because I'm totally dependent on
his abilities as a mechanic.

00:14:07.813 --> 00:14:09.371
Is he that good?

00:14:09.548 --> 00:14:12.210
He's better than good, he's incredible.

00:14:14.353 --> 00:14:16.617
I got a junky tank secondhand,

00:14:16.755 --> 00:14:20.521
but he tuned it up to perfection.
It was unbelievable.

00:14:21.727 --> 00:14:23.888
With an incredible sand tank like that,

00:14:24.129 --> 00:14:27.292
I felt like I'd be okay, even if
I went out into the desert alone.

00:14:29.001 --> 00:14:31.936
If Zankan... If I didn't have Pops,

00:14:32.137 --> 00:14:34.662
I probably wouldn't be doing the work I do now.

00:14:35.274 --> 00:14:36.400
That's what I think.

00:14:53.292 --> 00:14:55.522
You really are incredible, Pops.

00:14:55.728 --> 00:14:57.161
You like it that much?

00:14:57.463 --> 00:14:58.794
Yup, yup, yup.

00:14:59.098 --> 00:15:01.396
It's just super awesome, that PSP!

00:15:01.934 --> 00:15:03.663
I'm happy to hear it, really.

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:05.594
Take care of Hono for me.

00:15:05.771 --> 00:15:08.831
Hey Pops, he's my client!

00:15:09.208 --> 00:15:11.369
Why are you asking my client to do that?

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:13.771
Oh, right. Sorry about that.

00:15:14.079 --> 00:15:16.282
Hono, when'll we see you again?

00:15:16.282 --> 00:15:19.718
Hmm, when Bogie breaks down, I guess.

00:15:20.252 --> 00:15:22.379
Break down soon, okay Bogie?

00:15:22.488 --> 00:15:23.750
Unpleasant child.

00:15:26.525 --> 00:15:28.220
Well, we're going then. Take care!

00:15:28.294 --> 00:15:29.283
You too, Pops!

00:15:29.361 --> 00:15:31.597
Hono, bye-bye! See you later!

00:15:31.597 --> 00:15:33.360
Yup! Later!

00:15:40.039 --> 00:15:41.438
Now, then...

00:15:42.007 --> 00:15:43.565
The PSP again?

00:15:43.842 --> 00:15:48.370
Um, well, I want to take a closer
look at some of the system details.

00:15:48.514 --> 00:15:50.379
Don't give her a hard time, Iks.

00:15:50.582 --> 00:15:53.016
She's like a kid who just got a new toy.

00:15:53.485 --> 00:15:54.281
Shut up!

00:15:58.123 --> 00:15:58.885
What is it?

00:16:01.093 --> 00:16:02.526
Right now. Directly overhead.

00:16:02.761 --> 00:16:03.728
Directly overhead?

00:16:04.196 --> 00:16:05.993
I'm not picking up anything. Are you sure?

00:16:06.765 --> 00:16:07.561
It's gone!

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:08.994
It's not a life form.

00:16:09.335 --> 00:16:11.132
An autonomous soldier in invisible mode?

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:13.231
Are you saying it has a stealth coat?

00:16:14.173 --> 00:16:16.198
That's no ordinary capability.

00:16:16.575 --> 00:16:18.133
The only conceivable possibility is...

00:16:18.644 --> 00:16:20.612
Blue Breaker...

00:16:20.946 --> 00:16:22.811
Chances are extremely high.

00:16:23.148 --> 00:16:25.241
Bogie, turn around 180 degrees right now!

00:16:25.317 --> 00:16:26.215
Pops is in danger!

00:16:45.104 --> 00:16:46.366
Bogie, stop!

00:16:46.772 --> 00:16:47.796
What are you going to do?!

00:16:48.007 --> 00:16:49.065
What else?!

00:16:49.942 --> 00:16:52.111
If it really is Blue Breaker,

00:16:52.111 --> 00:16:53.908
it's far too risky to fight him!

00:17:09.094 --> 00:17:09.719
Activate!

00:17:22.074 --> 00:17:22.597
Descend!

00:17:28.113 --> 00:17:28.943
I'm coming!

00:17:29.348 --> 00:17:31.009
Pops! Millie!

00:17:39.158 --> 00:17:39.817
Pops!

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:46.854
Show all reconnaissance displays!

00:17:49.401 --> 00:17:50.163
Where are you?!

00:17:50.702 --> 00:17:51.464
Where...

00:17:55.707 --> 00:17:56.605
Where...

00:18:04.683 --> 00:18:05.081
It's coming!

00:18:19.998 --> 00:18:20.521
Next!

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:26.268
Where's Pops?

00:18:27.906 --> 00:18:28.804
Pops...

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:32.201
Magnify!

00:18:33.645 --> 00:18:34.407
Millie!

00:18:43.822 --> 00:18:44.584
Millie!

00:18:47.793 --> 00:18:48.760
Millie!

00:18:59.972 --> 00:19:01.667
He's still here, Honoka!

00:19:09.181 --> 00:19:10.614
You playing with me?!

00:19:11.116 --> 00:19:13.243
Quit messing around! Quit messing around!

00:19:47.052 --> 00:19:48.542
Blue Breaker!

00:20:02.467 --> 00:20:04.628
Even if she relied on her injured right hand,

00:20:04.736 --> 00:20:06.601
she would not have even the
smallest hope of victory.

00:20:07.239 --> 00:20:10.299
But somehow, there was no
sense that this was reality,

00:20:10.642 --> 00:20:12.303
nor was there a sense of sad resignation.

00:20:13.378 --> 00:20:16.481
Honoka was so calm,
she even surprised herself,

00:20:16.481 --> 00:20:18.881
as she faced Blue Breaker.

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:30.687
Honoka sensed scorn.

00:20:31.897 --> 00:20:36.527
A sneer on the face of the
expressionless murderer...

00:20:43.275 --> 00:20:44.264
He's gone.

00:20:50.082 --> 00:20:50.844
Miss Honoka!

00:21:06.365 --> 00:21:07.024
Millie!

00:21:14.706 --> 00:21:15.400
Miss Honoka.

00:21:25.183 --> 00:21:26.081
Miss Honoka...

00:21:28.453 --> 00:21:32.480
Honoka did not realize
herself that she was crying.

00:21:33.191 --> 00:21:34.818
Simply, she was bitterly disappointed.

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:38.454
At herself, for having been
unable to stop any of this.

00:21:39.064 --> 00:21:41.828
So bitterly disappointed, it made her tremble.

00:21:45.037 --> 00:21:48.040
A flexible civilization...
Juunan na bunmei wa

00:21:48.040 --> 00:21:50.542
...is always rapidly advancing.
Itsudatte nisshin-geppo

00:21:50.542 --> 00:21:53.512
You and your dreams are also...
Kimi to yume mo

00:21:53.512 --> 00:21:57.312
...making headway even now.
Genzai shinkou

00:22:02.854 --> 00:22:05.824
I realized for the first time...
Hajimete kizuitan da

00:22:05.824 --> 00:22:09.521
...with that line, resembling a surprise attack.
Fui-uchi ni nita sono serifu de

00:22:14.566 --> 00:22:17.502
My sixth sense was pried open.
Kojiakerareta dai-rokkan

00:22:17.502 --> 00:22:21.529
I'd been waiting for this feeling this whole time.
Kono kankaku o zutto matteita

00:22:25.544 --> 00:22:28.513
Opening my heart, just opening it...
Kokoro o hiraite tada hiraite

00:22:28.513 --> 00:22:31.483
I embrace the voices of strangers.
Daisansha no koe ukeireru

00:22:31.483 --> 00:22:34.353
Earnestly persevering, just persevering...
Hitasura koraete tada koraete

00:22:34.353 --> 00:22:37.447
I even try turning pages of criticism.
Hinan no peeji mo aketemiru

00:22:37.756 --> 00:22:40.726
I'm going to leave my...
Toushindai no boku wa

00:22:40.726 --> 00:22:43.593
...true-to-life self behind, right here.
Koko ni oite iku yo

00:22:43.662 --> 00:22:47.466
You can say whatever you want now...
Mou nanto itte kuretemo

00:22:47.466 --> 00:22:48.990
...and I'm fine with that.
Kekkou da

00:22:49.501 --> 00:22:54.973
Ah, how simple is the impulse to evolve.
Aa nante tanjun da shinka shitai to iu shoudou

00:22:54.973 --> 00:22:57.909
You and your dreams are also...
Kimi to yume mo

00:22:57.909 --> 00:23:01.106
...making headway even now.
Genzai shinkou

00:23:15.127 --> 00:23:16.856
Preview

00:23:17.529 --> 00:23:19.929
The blue astral eye I'd
hidden under the bandana...

00:23:20.732 --> 00:23:23.030
Millie finally found out about it, too.

00:23:23.735 --> 00:23:26.898
Because of this thing that indicates
I failed to become one of The Third,

00:23:27.005 --> 00:23:29.667
I don't really even remember
what my parents look like.

00:23:30.675 --> 00:23:33.337
Far away from us, as we spoke
of such long ago events,

00:23:33.445 --> 00:23:36.812
in Hyperius, a new plot was afoot.

00:23:37.616 --> 00:23:40.585
Next time on
The Third - The Girl With The Blue Eye,

00:23:40.719 --> 00:23:42.020
episode 5, "The Blue Astral Eye".

00:23:42.020 --> 00:23:43.255
The Blue Astral Eye
episode 5, "The Blue Astral Eye".

00:23:43.255 --> 00:23:44.882
The Blue Astral Eye
